---
const rows = [
  {
    before: '"What should even be in scope?" Weeks of back-and-forth before you can start.',
    after: '30-minute wizard maps your exact scope to your stack. No guesswork.',
  },
  {
    before: '"Implement logical access controls." Framework language that means nothing to a 10-person team.',
    after: 'Plain-English steps sized for your team, not a 500-person enterprise.',
  },
  {
    before: 'Policies written for auditors, not your team. They fail in sampling because nobody actually follows them.',
    after: 'Controls built around your real workflows. Auditors see what you actually do.',
  },
  {
    before: 'Evidence panic: scramble to collect everything the week before your audit. Repeat every year.',
    after: 'Continuous evidence structure maintained throughout the year. No scramble.',
  },
  {
    before: '$15-25k consultant to explain what a platform already told you.',
    after: 'Expert escalation for the 20% that genuinely needs judgment. Not the rest.',
  },
];
---
<section id="before-after" class="py-24 px-6 md:px-9 bg-light-bg border-y border-[#E0DFD9]">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">

    <p class="text-accent text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[1px] font-mono text-center mb-4 uppercase" data-animate>
      § 01 - BEFORE / AFTER
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-on-light text-center mb-4 tracking-[-0.8px] leading-[1.2]" data-animate>
      <span class="block">Most founders go in blind.</span>
      <span class="block">You don't have to.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-on-light-2 text-center text-[15px] mb-14 max-w-md mx-auto" data-animate>
      These are the gaps Axis-Scale closes. Every pattern here comes from founders who went through this.
    </p>

    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] border border-[#E0DFD9]" data-animate>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 bg-[#ECEAE6] border-b border-[#E0DFD9]">
        <div class="px-4 md:px-6 py-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[1px] font-mono text-on-light-3">Without guidance</div>
        <div class="px-4 md:px-6 py-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[1px] font-mono text-accent border-l border-[#E0DFD9]">With Axis-Scale</div>
      </div>

      {rows.map((row, i) => (
        <div class={`grid grid-cols-2${i < rows.length - 1 ? ' border-b border-[#E0DFD9]' : ''}`}>
          <div class="px-4 md:px-6 py-4 md:py-5 text-xs md:text-sm text-on-light-3 leading-relaxed">{row.before}</div>
          <div class="px-4 md:px-6 py-4 md:py-5 text-xs md:text-sm text-on-light leading-relaxed border-l border-[#E0DFD9] flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-ok mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
            <span>{row.after}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
